{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝ごはんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オクラ納豆でした(^L^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山﨑怜奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/03/27/4435939/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"學蘭歌劇「帝一の國」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を観に行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上美美子の回でしたo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔のこととか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人で話したこととか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々と思い出したら泣きました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく堂々と立っていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凛としていて、かっこよかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帝一の國自体も、最終章にして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて予定が合って観れました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"役者さん含め多くの方々の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こだわりや愛情が詰まっていることが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝わる作品でしたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観れて本当に良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"樋口美美子が想像つかなすぎる。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも、忙しい中本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様でした(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくり身体や喉を休めてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46